  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<div class="os-raise-ib-pset" data-button-text="Check" data-content-id="9dd5d108-833b-4184-985a-5b0fa5c972b8" data-fire-learning-opportunity-event="eventnameY" data-fire-success-event="eventnameX" data-retry-limit="2" data-schema-version="1.0">
  <!--Q1-->
  <exercise data-content-id="861d751b-8710-4cbb-944f-3f864cc41942" data-problem-comparator="integer" data-problem-type="input" data-solution="32">
    <problem>
      <para>Here are the first two terms of a geometric sequence: 2, 4. What is the 5th term in the sequence?  </para>
      </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! 32</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activities 4.15.3 – 4.15.4. </para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--2a-->
  <exercise data-content-id="f3f04229-6496-4233-8f4d-1bb32cb92dfb" data-problem-comparator="integer" data-problem-type="input" data-solution="1">
    <problem>
      <para>What are the common ratios of each geometric sequence? </para>
        <para>1, 1, 1, 1 </para>
        </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! 1</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activities 4.15.3 – 4.15.4.</para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
